    %% Detailed Functional Requirements
    G1 --> FR01["<b>FR-01: Multi-Angle Photo Ingestion</b><br/>Upload multi-view clinical photoset (Upload.tsx)"]:::frClass
    G1 --> FR02["<b>FR-02: Framing & Marker Detection</b><br/>Validate frame coverage & markers (Framing.tsx + VLM)"]:::frClass

    G2 --> FR03["<b>FR-03: Neural Depth & Pose Inference</b><br/>Estimate depth map & camera poses (inference.py + VGGT)"]:::frClass
    G2 --> FR04["<b>FR-04: Dense Point Cloud Generation</b><br/>Fuse 3D points & export scene_mesh.ply (pointcloud.py)"]:::frClass

    G3 --> FR05["<b>FR-05: Interactive 3D Cut Adjustment</b><br/>User aligns anatomical cut plane (Review.tsx + usePly)"]:::frClass
    G3 --> FR06["<b>FR-06: Selective Recut Execution</b><br/>Re-run stages 3-6 with new cut plane (POST /recut)"]:::frClass

    G4 --> FR07["<b>FR-07: Background Segmentation</b><br/>Filter floor, bed & marker bands (clean.py)"]:::frClass
    G4 --> FR08["<b>FR-08: Surface Mesh Reconstruction</b><br/>Reconstruct polygon surface mesh (reconstruct.py)"]:::frClass
    G4 --> FR09["<b>FR-09: Watertight Mesh Repair</b><br/>Fill holes & seal manifold geometry (watertight.py)"]:::frClass

    G5 --> FR10["<b>FR-10: Physical Scale & Volume Calc</b><br/>Calibrate scale via ArUco & compute volume (volume.py)"]:::frClass
    G5 --> FR11["<b>FR-11: Result Visualization & Export</b><br/>Interactive 3D viewing & metrics export (Result.tsx)"]:::frClass

    G6 --> FR12["<b>FR-12: Sequential Subprocess Dispatch</b><br/>Execute stagerun.py & report progress (jobs.py)"]:::frClass
